@MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080
@AccessToken = paste-your-jwt-access-token-here

# ==============================================================================
# 0. PUBLIC READER AUTHENTICATION (/api/public/auth)
# ==============================================================================

### 0.1 Reader Self-Registration (Auto-Active + Immediately Issues HttpOnly Cookies)
POST {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/auth/Register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "FirstName": "Claire",
  "LastName": "Moreau",
  "Username": "claire.moreau",
  "Email": "claire.moreau@ledition.com",
  "Password": "Reader@123",
  "ConfirmPassword": "Reader@123",
  "AvatarUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb",
  "Bio": "Collector of contemporary design books and photography essays."
}

### 0.2 Reader Login (Default Seeded Account: sophia.reader / Admin@123)
POST {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/auth/Login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "UsernameOrEmail": "sophia.reader",
  "Password": "Admin@123"
}

### 0.3 Reader Refresh Token (Rotates RefreshToken + 30-Second Grace Period)
POST {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/auth/Refresh
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "RefreshToken": ""
}

### 0.4 Get Current Authenticated Reader Profile (GET /Me)
GET {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/auth/Me
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 0.5 Update Current Reader Profile ([Authorize])
POST {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/auth/UpdateProfile
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "FirstName": "Sophia",
  "LastName": "Laurent",
  "Username": "sophia.reader",
  "Email": "sophia.reader@ledition.com",
  "AvatarUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544005313-94ddf0286df2",
  "Bio": "Design enthusiast and avid reader of contemporary architecture and slow living essays."
}

### 0.6 Change Reader Password ([Authorize])
POST {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/auth/ChangePassword
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "CurrentPassword": "Admin@123",
  "NewPassword": "Admin@123",
  "ConfirmNewPassword": "Admin@123"
}

### 0.7 Reader Logout (Revokes RefreshToken & Clears HttpOnly Cookies)
POST {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/auth/Logout
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}

# ==============================================================================
# 1. PUBLIC BROWSING ENDPOINTS (Unauthenticated / [AllowAnonymous])
# ==============================================================================

### 1.1 OpenAPI v1 Document
GET {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 Fetch the list of active article categories
GET {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/article-category/list
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 Fetch details of a specific article category by its slug
GET {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/article-category/beauty
Accept: application/json

### 1.4 Fetch paginated list of Published articles
GET {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/article/list?Page=1&PageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### 1.5 Fetch a single Published article and its linked gallery photos by slug
GET {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/article/the-art-of-quiet-luxury
Accept: application/json

# ==============================================================================
# 2. READER ARTICLE BOOKMARKS (/api/public/bookmark) [Phase 2]
# ==============================================================================

### 2.1 Toggle Article Bookmark (POST /toggle)
POST {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/bookmark/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "ArticleId": "01JART00000000000000000001"
}

### 2.2 Explicitly Add Article Bookmark (POST /add)
POST {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/bookmark/add
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "ArticleId": "01JART00000000000000000001"
}

### 2.3 Explicitly Remove Article Bookmark (POST /remove or DELETE /{articleId})
POST {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/bookmark/remove
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "ArticleId": "01JART00000000000000000001"
}

### 2.4 Check Bookmark Status for Article (GET /check/{articleId} - Anonymous or Authenticated)
GET {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/bookmark/check/01JART00000000000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.5 Get My Bookmarked Articles (GET /my-bookmarks)
GET {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/bookmark/my-bookmarks?Page=1&PageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json
